<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for using a mage's skill by using two skills at the same time.

How to use
F1 will use the skill twice.
F2 will use the skill after F1 once.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
